teraction","content":"**`@persik_hermes_bot`** is the Telegram surface for briefs, capture, and operations."},"93":{"id":"/docs/architecture-12","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#1-interaction","content":"**`@Persik_finbot`** is a separate Newfin finance product bot."},"94":{"id":"/docs/architecture-13","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#2-durable-memory","content":"**`Vault/`** contains journals, project notes, briefs, decisions, and `hot.md`."},"95":{"id":"/docs/architecture-14","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#2-durable-memory","content":"**Skills** are markdown playbooks. They keep the work portable across models and tools."},"96":{"id":"/docs/architecture-15","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#2-durable-memory","content":"**Git** versions the system and provides an auditable history."},"97":{"id":"/docs/architecture-16","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#3-always-on-loop","content":"Hermes Agent by Nous Research runs the COO loop on the VPS. It handles briefs, journal capture, Read Later, knowledge work, project sync, ops, scheduling, and orchestration."},"98":{"id":"/docs/architecture-17","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#3-always-on-loop","content":"The model provider is replaceable. The durable system is the vault, the skills, and the operating rules."},"99":{"id":"/docs/architecture-18","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#4-delegated-work","content":"Hermes can dispatch a bounded code, design, or research task to a temporary Cursor ACP worker. A worker gets the repository context and acceptance criteria, does the task in isolation, and returns a result for review."},"100":{"id":"/docs/architecture-19","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags"