type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#vps-crons-phase-1--2--explore","content":"**CC bridge v2:** `code` command — `codebase-memory-mcp cli` (`trace_path`, `search_graph`, `get_architecture`, `get_code_snippet`) on indexed `~/repos`; ripgrep fallback if graph empty. One-time VPS: `hermes-cbm-setup.sh` · weekly re-index Sun 06:30 · on-demand `index code`."},"502":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-83","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#vps-crons-phase-1--2--explore","content":"**Intel weekly (C5):** themes from research log + `GET /api/cron/intel-summary` (`intel_items` themes/assets/one-liners) + intel-brief ping; ops DM Sun 19:00. Requires Newfin deploy with `/intel-summary` route."},"503":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-84","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#vps-crons-phase-1--2--explore","content":"**Clip sweep:** VPS 07:00 + ops `sweep clips` — same as Mac morning-brief step 0; uses `journal-inbox?kind=clip` only (no Persik token on VPS)."},"504":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-85","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#vps-crons-phase-1--2--explore","content":"**Mac only:** `nastusha-vault-mirror.sh` runs inside `nastusha-brief-stage.sh` (iCloud STATUS → `Vault/Nastusha.md`)."},"505":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-86","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#vps-crons-phase-1--2--explore","content":"**GHA merge-poll:** optional `CRON_SECRET` + `NEWFIN_API_BASE` repo secrets → owner DM on new merges (`merge-poll-notify.sh`). When `HERMES_VPS_SSH_KEY` is set, each poll also runs `hermes-repos-pull.sh` on VPS (`~/repos` read clones)."},"506":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-87","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#vps-crons-phase-1--2--explore","content":"**Google Gmail + Calendar (Phase 15c):** readonly OAuth for VPS morning brief."},"507":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-88","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#vps-crons-phase-1--2--explore","content":"Google Cloud → enable Gmail API + Calendar API → OAuth desktop client → copy ID/secret to `.secrets/google-oauth.env`"},"508":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-89","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#vps-crons-phase-1--2--explore","content":"Mac: `python3 System/coo/google-oauth-setup.py` (browser consent → `.secrets/google-oauth-token.json`)"},"509":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-90","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#vps-crons-phase-1--2--explore","content":"`bash System/scripts/hermes-sync-google-oauth.sh` (token + env → VPS)"},"510":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-91","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#vps-crons-phase-1--2--explore","content":"Re-run after token refresh if Google revokes access"},"511":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-92","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#vps-crons-phase-1--2--explore","content":"Smoke: `python3 ~/.hermes/scripts/google-life-fetch.py` · cron log `~/morning-brief-vps.log`"},"512":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-93","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#vps-crons-phase-1--2--explore","content":"**Mac auto-pull:** LaunchAgent `com.jackie.dev-repos-pull` (30m + login) — `~/Jackie-OS` + `~/dev/*`; `System/scripts/dev-repos-pull-install.sh install`."},"513":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-94","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#web-dashboard-hermes-agent-admin-ui","content":"Localhost only on VPS `:9119`. **Not** in Persik — use SSH tunnel from Mac:"},"514":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-95","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#web-dashboard-hermes-agent-admin-ui","content":"Ser