":"**Local on VPS:** `hermes-ops-server` @ `:8787` still serves `POST /internal/ops/exec` for VPS crons / debugging on localhost."},"523":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-104","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#persik-ops-bridge-no-inbound-firewall","content":"**Script:** `~/.hermes/scripts/hermes-ops-exec.sh`. Verbs:"},"524":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-105","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#persik-ops-bridge-no-inbound-firewall","content":"`status` — health check + last line of cron logs"},"525":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-106","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#persik-ops-bridge-no-inbound-firewall","content":"`sync` — git pull + refresh `hot.md`"},"526":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-107","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#persik-ops-bridge-no-inbound-firewall","content":"`scout &#60;topic>` — Exa search"},"527":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-108","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#persik-ops-bridge-no-inbound-firewall","content":"`code &#60;question> &#60;repo>` — codebase-memory query"},"528":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-109","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#persik-ops-bridge-no-inbound-firewall","content":"`hot` — cat `Vault/hot.md`"},"529":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-110","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#persik-ops-bridge-no-inbound-firewall","content":"`merges` — latest merge-poll"},"530":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-111","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#persik-ops-bridge-no-inbound-firewall","content":"`flush research|journal` — drain inboxes"},"531":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-112","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#persik-ops-bridge-no-inbound-firewall","content":"`sweep clips` — drain clips inbox"},"532":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-113","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#persik-ops-bridge-no-inbound-firewall","content":"**Security:** Owner `chat_id` checked on Persik + in exec path. Each call wrapped with 25s timeout. Verbs only logged (never args). No arbitrary shell passthrough."},"533":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-114","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#persik-ops-bridge-no-inbound-firewall","content":"**Vercel env:** `HERMES_VPS_SSH_KEY` + `HERMES_OPS_PROXY_SECRET` + `TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_CHAT_ID`. Optional legacy: `HERMES_VPS_BASE_URL` (requires inbound `:8787`)."},"534":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-115","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#persik-ops-bridge-no-inbound-firewall","content":"**Related:** Concepts § ops-proxy."},"535":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-116","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#model-setup-subscriptions--no-nous-portal","content":"Gateway runs without this; Telegram replies need a model. **Do not use Nous Portal** — use existing subs + one Gemini API key."},"536":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-117","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#stack-2026-07-10-vps","content":"Profile"},"537":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-118","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#stack-2026-07-10-vps","content":"Chain (primary → fallbacks)"},"538":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-119","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#stack-2026-07-10-vps","content":"Effort"},"539":{"id":"/docs/hermes-runbook-120","page_id":"/docs/hermes-runbook","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/hermes-runbook#stack-2026-07-10-vps","content":"**`default`** (live gateway)"},"540":{"id":"/